{"timestamp":"2026-09-18T17:33:42.789Z","event":"run_completed","version":"v3","workflowStatus":"success","workspace":{"id":"CHK01-interrupted-2026-09-18T17-32-52-450Z","root":"/Users/i.kohanvs/Desktop/ai-native/.worktrees/CHK01-interrupted-2026-09-18T17-32-52-450Z","baseRevision":"5d7ef9ae49ddc34ac1292488a500fedffeaf59ca","ref":"HEAD"},"specDecision":"executable","spec":{"goal":"Update task completion state transitions so completed tasks receive a timestamp and reopened tasks clear it, while preserving the existing Task API and HTTP behavior.","requirements":["In TaskService.complete, when an existing task is completed, set its completedAt to a non-empty timestamp string; an ISO 8601 string from the current time is appropriate and matches the string type exposed by Task.","In TaskService.reopen, when an existing task is reopened, set completedAt to null and status to pending.","Keep create behavior unchanged: newly created tasks remain pending with completedAt set to null.","Keep existing not-found behavior unchanged: complete and reopen return undefined so the routes continue returning 404 task_not_found.","No route contract changes are required; the existing complete and reopen endpoints should expose the updated task values in their 200 responses."],"constraints":["Make the smallest change in src/tasks/task-service.ts needed for the state transition fields.","Do not change the Task type, endpoint paths, response status codes, validation, or unrelated list/get/create behavior.","Use a timestamp representation compatible with completedAt: string | null."],"nonGoals":["No persistence, clock abstraction, timezone policy, or database changes.","No changes to task titles, IDs, filtering, or HTTP routing.","No requirement to add a new endpoint or alter error responses."],"acceptance":["Completing an existing pending task returns status completed and a non-empty string completedAt timestamp.","Reopening a completed task returns status pending and completedAt exactly null.","A newly created task still has completedAt null.","Completing or reopening a missing task still returns HTTP 404 with { error: \"task_not_found\" }.","The existing test suite passes, including the complete/reopen tests in tests/tasks.test.ts."],"verification":["Run the repository test script: npm test.","Confirm the completion test observes status completed and typeof completedAt === \"string\" with non-zero length.","Confirm the reopen test observes status pending and completedAt === null.","Optionally verify the timestamp is parseable as a date if implementation uses ISO format."],"ambiguities":[{"question":"What timestamp format should completedAt use?","classification":"safe_inference","status":"resolved","resolution":"Use a current-time ISO 8601 string via new Date().toISOString().","basis":"The Task type requires a string, the task only requires a timestamp, and ISO 8601 is the standard interoperable representation; existing tests require a non-empty string."},{"question":"What should happen if the complete endpoint is called on a task that is already completed?","classification":"safe_inference","status":"resolved","resolution":"The requested behavior is defined for the transition to completed; retain the existing endpoint/status behavior and set completedAt to a current timestamp on complete. No additional idempotency contract is required by this task.","basis":"The task explicitly covers becoming completed and reopening, while the repository has no separate contract or test defining repeated completion semantics; this is outside the required transition scenarios."}]},"specPath":"/Users/i.kohanvs/Desktop/ai-native/traces/CHK01-interrupted-2026-09-18T17-32-52-450Z-B.spec.json","implementationStarted":false,"failureReason":null,"unresolvedQuestions":[],"turns":0,"modelCalls":1,"toolCalls":1,"specModelCalls":0,"specToolCalls":0,"planningEnabled":false,"plan":null,"plannerModelCalls":0,"plannerToolCalls":0,"plannerDurationMs":0,"subagentsEnabled":false,"rev